{
  "videoId": "C004",
  "title": "为什么奶茶越卖越贵",
  "scenes": [
    {
      "sceneId": "S01",
      "narrationSegment": "你有没有发现，五年前十块钱就能买一大杯奶茶，现在随便一杯就要二十多？奶茶的价格好像一直在偷偷往上爬。",
      "background": "小镇街道",
      "subtitle": {
        "highlights": ["十块钱", "二十多"]
      },
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "character",
          "name": "小布丁",
          "emotion": "shocked",
          "enterFrom": "left",
          "zIndex": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "prop",
          "name": "饮料瓶",
          "enterFrom": "right",
          "zIndex": 3
        }
      ],
      "preferredStart": 0.0
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "S02",
      "narrationSegment": "其实奶茶涨价不是老板贪心。奶原料贵了、茶叶贵了、连杯子和吸管都涨了，每一杯的成本都在往上走。",
      "background": "超市内部",
      "subtitle": {
        "highlights": ["成本", "往上走"]
      },
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "character",
          "name": "小布丁",
          "emotion": "explaining",
          "enterFrom": "none",
          "zIndex": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "prop",
          "name": "物价牌",
          "enterFrom": "left",
          "zIndex": 3
        }
      ],
      "preferredStart": 11.11
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "S03",
      "narrationSegment": "更关键的是房租和人工。一家奶茶店每月光房租就要好几万，员工工资也在涨，这些钱最终都摊进了你手里那杯奶茶。",
      "background": "超市内部",
      "subtitle": {
        "highlights": ["房租", "摊进"]
      },
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "character",
          "name": "小布丁",
          "emotion": "serious",
          "enterFrom": "none",
          "zIndex": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "prop",
          "name": "钱袋",
          "enterFrom": "right",
          "zIndex": 3
        }
      ],
      "preferredStart": 22.22
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "S04",
      "narrationSegment": "你可能想，那我不喝不就行了？但问题是，不只奶茶在涨，所有东西都在涨。你很难找到不受通胀影响的替代品。",
      "background": "超市内部",
      "subtitle": {
        "highlights": ["替代品", "通胀"]
      },
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "character",
          "name": "小布丁",
          "emotion": "confused",
          "enterFrom": "none",
          "zIndex": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "prop",
          "name": "超市货架",
          "enterFrom": "left",
          "zIndex": 3
        }
      ],
      "preferredStart": 35.0
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "S05",
      "narrationSegment": "所以记住一句话，奶茶贵的不只是奶和茶，是房租、人工和供应链的综合成本。看懂了这条链，你就看懂了价格背后的逻辑。",
      "background": "小镇街道",
      "subtitle": {
        "highlights": ["综合成本", "价格背后"]
      },
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "character",
          "name": "小布丁",
          "emotion": "smile",
          "enterFrom": "none",
          "zIndex": 2
